      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To test for specific chemical potencies, you would need a professional-grade air quality monitoring system equipped with VOC sensors, rather than a standard home monitor. Instruments like Photoionization Detectors (PIDs) can specifically detect and quantify various volatile organic compounds released from hydroponic or plant systems. However, interpreting these results accurately often requires professional air sampling and lab analysis.",
      "source": "target",
